---
config:
  sequence:
    actorMargin: 20
    width: 110
    diagramMarginX: 20
    wrap: true
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor Caller as Caller
  participant Owner as Current native front
  participant Pub as Managed program / publisher
  participant Runner as Job runner
  participant Transport as Result transport
  Caller->>Owner: Session request
  Owner->>Owner: Retain selection guard and workspace
  Note over Owner: Worker reap is a prerequisite, see acquisition limits
  Owner->>Owner: Reserve stdout, child output uses stderr
  Owner->>Transport: Allocate fresh private channel
  Owner->>Runner: Launch own job with that channel
  Pub->>Transport: Write complete result, first no-clobber link wins
  Note over Pub,Runner: Publication requests ending, it is not successful completion
  Runner->>Runner: Observe appearance or natural exit, end group before reap
  Runner->>Runner: Reap, recover terminal, confirm group
  Runner-->>Owner: Own ending, status, appearance, group result
  Owner->>Transport: Validate anchored exact result using own ending
  Owner->>Owner: Attempt mask / channel / private / output cleanup
  Note over Owner: Drop output and selection guard before joining latches
  Owner->>Owner: Join cancellation, report cleanup/group diagnostics
  alt Cancel
    Owner-->>Caller: Cancellation, no result
  else Result error
    Owner-->>Caller: Original result failure, with cleanup/group diagnostics
  else Cleanup error
    Owner-->>Caller: First cleanup failure, with all cleanup/group diagnostics
  else Live group
    Owner-->>Caller: Group failure, no result
  else Success
    Owner->>Owner: Write exact bytes and flush stdout, write can fail
    Owner-->>Caller: Successful status only after write, empty result remains distinct
  end
